      "Code": "re  = open(r\"U:\\17_TrainingAdvanceDynamo\\2_WORKING\\Tool\\Dynamo\\Training-Dynamo-2024\\DesignScript.py\", \"r\")\r\n\r\ninterpret = re.read()\r\n\r\nOUT =  interpret",
